&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You&#39;ll design across the whole Casino mix: campaign visuals, promotional, CRM, in-product, paid and OOH, at a standard that exceeds anything in the category, and at a pace that keeps a fast calendar moving.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You&#39;ll work from the Casino design system and you&#39;ll make it better. We want your view on how it could work harder for the whole team.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design across push, email, in-app messaging, content cards, bottom sheets, promo cards, details pages, paid social, OOH and video.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Take briefs from concept through to final, spec-correct delivery.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and improve components, templates and usage guidance in the design system.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work alongside creatives, motion designers and creative ops on shared projects.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hand off clean files: correct naming, sensible versioning, layers someone else can open.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build legal, regulatory and responsible gaming requirements into your work from the start, so it arrives at review, ready to go.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you bring&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5+ years in a design role in an agency or in-house studio.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A portfolio strong across digital and campaign design, with evidence of both conceptual pieces and high-volume work.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Expert-level Figma and strong Adobe Creative Suite (Photoshop, Illustrator, InDesign).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent typography, hierarchy and layout, including at small sizes or a busy social feed.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Speed and accuracy together: you can move fast and get it right.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The ability to take direction, sharpen the work and keep moving.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Bonus points&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;iGaming, sports betting or entertainment experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;High-volume CRM or lifecycle design experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Motion or 3D capability.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your first 90 days&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You&#39;ll learn the brand and the system, ship live work across all channels, and bring us one idea for making how we design even better.&lt;/p&gt;
